msgstr "Surcharger le réglage WordPress « Agrandir en cliquant »"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:6056
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:6056
msgid ""
"When enabled, disables WordPress built-in gallery window and uses MetaSlider "
"Gallery for images set to \"Enlarge on Click\". When disabled, respects "
"WordPress setting and skips images set to \"Enlarge on Click\"."
msgstr ""
"Lorsqu’il est activé, il désactive la fenêtre galerie native de WordPress et "
